versity of A Coruña and is recognized as a professional in the Endocrinology and Nutrition Service at the hospital.", "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO CRUCES:Hospital Universitario Cruces is a medical facility located in Barakaldo, Vizcaya, near Bilbao. It specializes in endocrinology and nutrition. The hospital is notable for its leadership in the Endocrinology and Nutrition section, with Dr. Fco. Javier Santamaría Sandi serving as the Head of this section since 2007. Additionally, Virginia Bellido Castañeda is also mentioned as working in the same department, holding the position of Head of Section in Endocrinology and Nutrition.", "COMPLEJO HOSPITALARIO UNIVERSITARIO DE EL FERROL:The Complex University Hospital of El Ferrol is a healthcare institution where Diego Bellido Guerrero serves as the Head of Service in Endocrinology and Nutrition.", "SOCIEDAD ANDALUZA DE ENDOCRINOLOGÍA, DIABETES Y NUTRICIÓN:The Sociedad Andaluza de Endocrinología, Diabetes y Nutrición (SAEDYN) is a scientific and professional society dedicated to the fields of endocrinology, diabetes, and nutrition. It plays a significant role in the accreditation of continuous training activities related to these specialties, ensuring that healthcare professionals remain updated with the latest knowledge and practices. The society is currently presided over by Martín López de la Torre Casares, who leads its initiatives and activities aimed at advancing the understanding and treatment of endocrine disorders and nutritional issues in the Andalusian region.", "LABORATORIOS ESTEVE:Laboratorios Esteve is a pharmaceutical company that sponsored the educational material for the project discussed in the document.", "ENDOCRINOLOGY AND NUTRITION:The specialty of Endocrinology and Nutrition encompasses the study and management of various pathologies related to hormonal and nutritional health.", "PRESENTACIÓN:The presentation discusses the specialty of Endocrinology and Nutrition, highlighting the need for continuous education and the resources available for professionals in the field.", "DIABETES 2.0:Diabetes 2.0 is a working group within the Spanish Society of Diabetes (SED) focused on modern approaches to diabetes management.", "TÉCNICAS APLICADAS A LA DIABETES:The Applied Technologies in Diabetes is a working group within the Spanish Society of Diabetes (SED) that focuses on technological advancements in diabetes care.", "DR. MARTÍN CUESTA HERNÁNDEZ:Dr. Martín Cuesta Hernández is a specialist in Endocrinology and Nutrition at Hospital Universitario Clínico San Carlos in Madrid.", "DR. MIGUEL A. RUBIO HERRERA:Dr. Miguel A. Rubio Herrera is the Head of the Endocrinology and Nutrition Section at Hospital Clínico San Carlos in Madrid.", "DR. FRANCISCO JAVIER ESCALADA SAN MARTÍN:Dr. Francisco Javier Escalada San Martín is the Director of the Department of Endocrinology and Nutrition at Clínica Universidad de Navarra in Pamplona.", "DR. FCO. JAVIER SANTAMARÍA SANDI:Dr. Fco. Javier Santamaría Sandi is the Head of the Endocrinology Section at Hospital Universitario Cruces in Barakaldo, Vizcaya.", "DR. MARTÍN LÓPEZ DE LA TORRE CASA:Dr. Martín López de la Torre Casares is the Head of the Endocrinology and Nutrition Service at Hospital Universitario Virgen de las Nieves in Granada.", "DRA. ANA M.ª URIOSTE FONDO:Dra. Ana M.ª Urioste Fondo works in the Endocrinology and Nutrition Service at Complejo Asistencial Universitario de León."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}